			"notes": "# What’s New?\nThis is a patch release and it fixes some crucial bugs.\n\n## What bugs?\n1. There was a bug that didn’t allow cats to be unsat after being tamed using a custom item.\n2. You could feed a baby which would spam chat messages constantly.\n\n## Anything else?\nI also removed the messages which arrived after you fed a cat any custom item, now only messages for effects and breeding are posted (except also taming for cat food tin). \n\nThat’s it!\n\n## Auto-generated\n\n## What's Changed\n* Fix codacy issues by @Spacexplorer11 in https://github.com/Spacexplorer11/Meow_Meals/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Spacexplorer11/Meow_Meals/compare/v1.0.1...v1.0.2"
		},
