			"notes": "# What's changed?\nThis release fixs a very small typo which caused an issue of you not being able to craft `Meat Feast`. I also forgot to commit my changes to add potion effects based on what food the cat is eating 🤦‍♂️. I'm really sorry for the inconvenience, and I hope to never do this again. I have also updated the build.gradle file with the new version."
